WEBVTT

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:23.500
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.490
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.490
<b>We Were Always Like This</b>

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:02.980
Coming...

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.220
Yeah, I'm coming. Who is it?

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.490
Oh, Hika-nee.

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:15.690
I'm back from Tokyo.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:17.940
Let's play, Natsumi!

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.320
Okay!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.700
Sweet! So what should we play?

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.680
I just got off the Shinkansen,

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.230
so I wanna do something that 
involves moving around a lot!

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:32.620
All right! In that case...

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:35.110
I'll show you my Surefire Kill Shot,

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:37.880
the new finisher shot I've been 
working on while you were away!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.520
Surefire Kill? What the heck?

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.370
Whatever! Bring it!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:46.350
Finisher: Surefire Kill Shot!

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:53.480
Okay, don't actually use surefire 
kill finishers, idiot!

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:16.640
Don't actually use surefire 
kill finishers, idiot.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.470
Was the first time you said 
it a conditioned reflex?

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.340
Come on! This is what you 
do the minute I get home?!

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:27.050
My fun time back at home is already over!

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:30.710
My finisher, Surefire Kill Shot, 
kills anything and everything.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.850
Well, don't kill my visit 
home with it, too!

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:36.150
What are we gonna do?

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.970
If your mom finds out, 
she'll wring our necks.

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:41.670
Hmm... Well, yeah, I guess so.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.790
However, Hika-nee! Just think about this!

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:51.410
We've faced and overcome countless 
situations like this before, haven't we?

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.280
Uh, yeah, I don't remember 
overcoming any...

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:58.700
I believe it would be best to learn from 
our past and apologize immediately.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.470
Th-That sounds way too reasonable!

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.690
Are you really Natsumi?!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:08.090
I'm not the same Natsumi-chan 
you knew before.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:11.120
But I worry that this idea 
alone isn't enough.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.700
We should come up with other options 
in the event of an emergency.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.490
G-Good point...

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:18.850
My second proposal is 
destruction of evidence.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:23.490
But that wouldn't solve the actual problem. 
It would only delay the inevitable.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.100
Yeah... That's a last resort.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:29.240
And I have a third, creative proposal.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:32.310
Oh? What is it? Tell me!

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:41.300
We collect clay from the ground and 
recreate the planter from scratch!

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.460
You're definitely the 
same Natsumi as before.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.220
The first plan's obviously the best!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.110
Let's go apologize right now!

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.290
Okay.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:51.450
But if it comes to it, 
we use the third one.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.180
They're only two that matter, you doofus!

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:57.430
O-Okay, let's find your 
mom and apologize to—

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:00.200
Hey, Hika-nee, you're back home?

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.260
Sorry!

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:12.710
We were just talking about what pose 
we'd use if we were Sentai heroes!

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:16.660
Nee-chan, sorry, but could 
you leave us alone for now?

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.480
Our future is riding on this.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.870
What are you talking about?

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.540
W-Well, if you two are playing 
by yourselves, that's fine.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:25.510
See you later, Hika-nee.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:26.860
S-Sure.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:31.950
Is she gone?

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:33.490
Looks like it.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:36.280
Anyway, Hika-nee, I just realized something!

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:37.010
What?

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:40.980
What if Nee-chan or Nii-chan 
were to see this?

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:45.030
Even if we apologize, it'll look like we're 
only doing it because we got caught.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.490
We need to find Mom and apologize 
before anyone finds out.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:51.910
Then can't one of us stay here 
and make sure no one comes by?

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.310
Hika-nee, are you not aware

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:01.880
of the things called "sincerity points" 
that you get when you apologize?

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.500
Do I look like I'm aware?

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:06.580
If just one of us goes to apologize,

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:10.500
the question of why the other one 
didn't also apologize will follow,

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.420
and we lose 40 sincerity points.

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:14.560
Those 40 points are huge!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:15.440
Uh-huh...

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:19.410
We both go together, clearly explain 
what happened, and apologize.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:22.200
That'll give us 30 sincerity points.

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:24.750
And if we apologize in the 
Sentai poses from before,

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:25.860
we lose 100 points!

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:30.030
Whoa, whoa! Seriously, let's not do 
anything that'll lose us points!

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.360
You know, why don't we just 
yell for your mom from here?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:38.040
No, that would only disturb the 
neighbors, which adds to our crimes.

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:41.880
For now, we'll just find Mom as 
soon as we can and apologize.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.150
O-Okay, fine.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.920
Not here.

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:54.820
Not here.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.110
Th-That's weird...

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:59.200
I can't find Mom anywhere.

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:01.530
Maybe she's just not home?

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:06.580
Hey, Nee-chan, do you know where Mom is?

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:07.730
Mom?

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:13.600
Uh... I think she went to the candy store 
to buy rice crackers, since we ran out...

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.120
Th-The candy store?!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.220
Hika-nee!

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.160
Come with me! Time to make a strategy!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:19.850
Right!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.070
What's up with those two?

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:24.090
Well, what now?

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:27.100
We were gonna apologize right away, 
but your mom's not home!

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:29.890
Shouldn't we come up with 
an emergency plan?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.060
At this point, I guess we'll have to.

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:37.690
I'm not sure if we can get clay 
from our yard, though...

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.850
No, not the third plan! 
There are only two proposals here!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:45.900
For now, we should hide the planter 
before Komari or your brother find it.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.990
Then, when your mom gets home, 
we'll apologize to her.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:52.030
I'm not too enthusiastic about that, 
but if it's what you want...

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.650
Well, get enthusiastic!

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:56.070
Argh, we can't drag this out any longer!

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.910
Natsumi, get a bag we can put 
the pieces of the planter in!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.790
I'll stand guard at the crime scene!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:01.700
Roger!

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:07.500
Honestly, I only went to 
buy rice crackers...

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:10.710
That Kaede-chan is one shrewd saleswoman.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.930
Well, I have hungry teens 
at home, so it'll be fine.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.830
Hika-nee, I brought a bag.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:17.650
Good!

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.300
Put all the pieces in the bag.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.190
Got it!

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.700
Wait, what do we do with the tree?

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.940
Hide it in the bushes or something.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:29.330
The ball might give away the fact that we 
broke the planter, so let's hide it, too.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.390
Done and done, Hika-nee!

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:32.610
Okay!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.850
All right, all the evidence is concealed!

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:37.270
Let's scram before we get caught!

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:41.910
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.910
Gah! We got totally chewed out!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:45.620
Wait, why are you getting mad at me?

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:50.030
If you hadn't said anything weird, 
we would've gotten off a lot easier!

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:52.510
I mean, you seemed on board 
with it at the time.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.620
Besides, this happened because you 
didn't catch my Surefire Kill Shot.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.270
That was nothing but a wild pitch!

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:01.760
Hey! Are you mocking my Surefire Kill Shot?

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:02.720
Yes!

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:04.710
What?!

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.470
What?!

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:09.640
Why, you!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.430
I'm going to bed.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.310
But it's still early, Hika-nee.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.670
I ended up getting in trouble as 
soon as I made it back home.

00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:37.380
Going to see Natsumi straight 
away was a mistake.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:42.620
She's always been nothing 
but trouble for me.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:48.380
I'm going to bed.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.720
Huh? But it's so early.

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:55.040
Night.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.480
Night...

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:05.080
Why'd I have to get yelled at by 
not just Mom, but Hika-nee, too?

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:08.210
I know I was the one who threw the ball,

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:11.310
but she was playing with me, 
so why'd she have to get mad?

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:21.260
Now that I think about it, she and I...

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.200
Hika-nee and I always...

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:33.160
...fought all the time.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.030
So hot...

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.940
I came outside because I was bored,

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.910
but it's insanely hot.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.960
What's that? A cat?

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:06.100
Hey! Are you a cat?

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:08.180
Come on out!

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:23.290
A...

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.790
A komuso just popped out of the bushes!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.250
<b>Banana</b>

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:29.210
That's right! My name is Komuso Man!

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:33.740
Even you could never guess 
my true identity, Hika-nee!

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:37.850
Why do you have a laundry basket 
on your head, Natsumi?

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:43.610
I was playing by myself!

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.190
You just revealed your identity...

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:48.580
Hika-nee, got anything to do?

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.230
If you don't, let's do this!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.070
Huh?

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:54.320
Do what? You mean playing 
pretend with that?

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.340
Yeah!

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:58.390
We'll do rock-paper-scissors to 
see who gets to be Komuso Man!

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.870
Wait, wait! Are you nuts? 
I'm not doing that!

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:04.060
You gotta throw something, or you lose!

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:04.910
Uh, are you listening?!

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:06.150
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.150
Shoot!

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:09.220
Yeah! I win!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:17.140
Okay, since you won, you can do 
all the pretending you want,

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.620
and I'll do what I want to do.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.710
Why?

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.990
You won, so shouldn't you be Komuso Man?

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:39.710
And what even <i>is</i> this character, anyway?

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.900
How am I supposed to interact with you?

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:44.070
You look so cool...

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:48.280
Don't worry about that! That doesn't 
matter! Let's just play pretend now!

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.750
My name is Komuso Man!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.840
I will bring the hammer of 
justice down upon evil!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:05.050
There you are, Komuso Man, you fiend!

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:08.000
I, Natsumi-chan, will get rid of you!

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:11.460
Huh? Oh, this guy's a fiend?

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.810
Take this!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.360
Bring it on!

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:20.780
Hup!

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:23.530
Heh, what's the matter?

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.920
You're never gonna beat me that way!

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:31.790
Nyah, nyah! If you don't like 
that, just try to beat me!

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:34.360
How about this, then?!

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:35.740
Forbidden Shin Kick!

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:42.190
How 'bout now?! Ready to give up?!

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:44.980
You can never beat me, Hika-nee!

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:47.230
If you don't like that, 
just try and catch me!

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:52.190
That's what you get, Komuso Man!

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:53.020
Not my shins...

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:55.940
That's what you get, Komuso Man!

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:56.440
No, seriously, going for 
the shins is wrong.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.050
What the heck is with her?

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:03.040
I'm gonna make her pay!

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:04.560
I'll catch you just like you wanted

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:07.520
and beat you to a pulp!

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:10.730
Hold up, Natsumi!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.900
She sure runs away fast...

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:21.430
Right! This way! My instinct 
tells me she's this way!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.310
Cattle Crossing

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:41.030
No... seriously... why even run away?

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:46.520
Komuso Man's already worn out... 
before the battle even started...

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:49.330
I gotta find somewhere to rest...

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:53.160
Konomi-chan, aren't these Popsicles yummy?

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.450
They are.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.410
Oh, it's Hika-nee.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:02.130
Huh? Hikage-chan, why are 
you dressed like that?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.970
She's Komuso Man.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:07.000
Hika-nee, Konomi-chan bought us Popsicles!

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:08.940
The kind that break in two!

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:12.350
Huh? No, wait...

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:14.890
What happened to playing pretend?

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.670
Oh, I'm done with that.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.160
Oh. I see.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:24.250
Anyway, these Popsicles are two in one!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.850
Wanna have one, too?

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:29.820
Of course I do.

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:35.710
It fell...

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:42.750
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.710
Go straight home after school

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:44.710
What?

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.450
You can't play today?

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:50.670
Yeah, I was planning to go 
shopping in town today.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:54.920
Aw... But I wanted to go to the 
secret base you showed me before.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:57.240
If you want to go, go by yourself.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.750
This is also your punishment 
for yesterday, you know.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:02.440
Huh?

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:08.110
Okay, fine. I'll go by myself.

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.660
Good. Go for it.

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:35.290
I thought it was around here...

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:41.970
Found it!

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:59.680
I tried to go shopping, but I didn't 
find anything worth buying.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:03.080
Maybe I should've just stayed 
at home doing nothing.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.320
Hikage-chan!

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.330
Auntie Yukiko?

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:08.820
What's wrong?

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.420
Have you seen Natsumi?

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.050
Huh?

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:15.510
She hasn't made it home yet.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.770
Who knows where she wandered off to?

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:20.500
If you see her, let me know, okay?

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:21.790
Please!

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:37.200
Natsumi!

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:39.180
I know you're here, Natsumi!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.890
No way... She's not here?

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.030
Guess I had it wrong.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:51.080
No, once she says she'll do something, 
there's no changing her mind.

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:53.600
I'm sure she was here.

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.510
She might still be nearby.

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:33.930
What are you doing out here?

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.280
Hika-nee...

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:41.630
I scraped my knees...

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:46.300
And then I couldn't find the way home...

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.180
And... And...

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:01.240
Let's go home.

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:09.830
Hika-nee...

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:10.830
Hmm?

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.930
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:18.040
It's fine.

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:21.540
I was wrong to tell you to 
play by yourself, too.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.000
Hika-nee...

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:30.290
Hm?

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:32.770
Can you play tomorrow?

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.240
Sure. I can play.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:50.130
Hika-nee...

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:51.460
What now?

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.630
Apologize to my mom with me.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.140
No way, doofus! Get in trouble by yourself!

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:24.900
So early, and it's already this hot...

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.100
I don't feel like doing 
anything when it's this hot.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.460
There you are, Komuso Man!

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:37.160
Wh-What are you doing, Re—

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:39.860
Wait, Natsumi's with you?

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:42.380
I was playing with Nattsun.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.220
Hey, I know!

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:47.330
Since all three of us are here, 
let's go to the secret base!

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:48.870
But...

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:54.030
It's... so hot today...

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:55.740
Hika-nee...

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:03.140
C-Come with us... to the secret base.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:32.150
Okay. Let's go to the secret base.

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:37.010
Wow! You're actually agreeing to 
something for once, Hika-nee!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.520
Okay, Renge! Get your hat and water bottle!

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:43.850
Hey, Hika-nee! Your feet are wide open!

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:45.840
Finisher: Shin Kick!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:48.790
Ow! What the heck have 
you been teaching her?!

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:50.840
Ren-chon, run for it!

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.440
Run!

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:55.230
Darn it, Natsumi! 
You're gonna pay for that!

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:04.760
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:13.470
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:33.330
The Cosmos Detectives!

00:23:33.330 --> 00:23:33.980
Yeah!

00:23:33.980 --> 00:23:36.540
One... one... zero...

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:38.860
Wait, Renge! Don't call 
the police! Seriously!

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:40.930
Renge-chan! I found the arrest 
warrant on the ground!

00:23:40.930 --> 00:23:43.180
Thanks for the tomato, Onee-chan!

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:44.670
I'm impressed, Ren-chon.

00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:46.940
What?! I-I knew it!

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:50.950
<b>Next Time
Episode 4</b>

